  "description": "Test build of Aatrox's Infernal Chains as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Aatrox so his W chains only the unit it hits - a champion or monster is tethered to the spot for 1.5 s, leaving the ring breaks the chain, otherwise it is pulled back to the ring's centre and hit again; minions take double damage. v0.2: the ring, the snap and the hits are played by the data from the add-on's flags. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
